    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public service law, in relation to allowing certain\ncustomer-generators who generate solar electricity to donate credit for such\nelectricity to low-income families",
    "basePrintNo": "S6919",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6919-2021",
